{"id":"bataille","lemma":"bataille","pos":"noun","rank":1241,"glosses":["battle","war (card game)"],"ipa":"/ba.taj/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/Fr-bataille.ogg/Fr-bataille.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"batailles"},"formAudio":{"batailles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-batailles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Es-tu prêt pour la bataille ?","en":"Are you ready for the battle?","words":[{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"ready"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Nous ne pouvons pas gagner cette bataille.","en":"We can't win this battle.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to win"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons gagné la bataille.","en":"We won the fight.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to win","l":"gagner"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"On peut gagner toutes les batailles mais perdre la guerre.","en":"You can win all the battles yet lose the war.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to win"},{"g":"all","l":"tout"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"but"},{"g":"to lose"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"war"}]},{"text":"La bataille dura une semaine.","en":"The battle lasted a week.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to last","l":"durer"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"week"}]}]}